{"2270230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Glitch Party", "steam_appid": 2270230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitch Party is a party game for 2-8 players online. Challenge your friends in different minigames, each with a small chance of being glitched. Welcome to Glitch Party!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.poster.avif?t=1758643108\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.webm?t=1758643108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.mp4?t=1758643108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in varius different minigames. Racing, fighting, strategic competitions, last to survive, and many others. Powered by Unreal Engine 5 you get beautiful maps, physics, and lighting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitched Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame has a small chance of spawning as a glitched version. With more action, and different twists, it spices things up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 8 different characters each with their own voice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glitch Party is made by Gyllensten Games, a solo developer game studio creating its first game.</p>",